[UK-TSRGD-9(1)(a)] [mandatory] The Traffic Signs Regulations and General Directions 2016 (SI 2016/362), Schedule 9: road markings and their significance, section 9(1)(a), page 9
subject to sub-paragraphs (2) to (4), no vehicle is to stop on any length of road along which the marking has been placed at any point between the ends of the marking;

[UK-TSRGD-10] [recommended] The Traffic Signs Regulations and General Directions 2016 (SI 2016/362), Schedule 9: road markings and their significance, section 10, page 11
